- Tests in `engine/server.test.ts` and `engine/fleet.test.ts` against temp pools with real pids: self-written pid, live refusal (pid + pool dir, port only when registry matches), stale takeover, bogus pid files, no-force refusal, and a CLI subprocess that exits non-zero.

